  "text": "Veterinary Emergency and Specialty Care | Partner Veterinary\nSkip to content\nFrederick 301.200.8185\nRichmond 804.206.9122\nEmergency\nFrederick, MD\nRichmond, VA\nSpecialties\nFrederick, MD\nInternal Medicine – Frederick\nOncology – Frederick\nNeurology-Frederick\nSurgery – Frederick\nCardiology – Frederick\nRichmond, VA\nNeurology-RICHMOND\nOncology – Richmond\nCritical Care -Richmond\nCardiology – Richmond\nInternal Medicine – RICHMOND\nSurgery – Richmond\nAbout Us\nOur Doctors\nCareers\nPet Parents\nBlog\nConditions and Treatments\nPodcast\nFAQ\nKnow Before You Go\nPre-Register\nMy Pet Needs to be Hospitalized, Now What?\nPayment Options\nPet Loss\nShare Your Story\nVeterinarians\nContinuing Education\nRefer\nRequest Materials\nHome\nEmergency Frederick\nEmergency Richmond\nFrederick, MD Specialty Services\nRichmond, VA Specialty Services\nPet Parents\nVeterinarians\nOur Doctors\nCareers\nContact Us\nWorking With  Passion\nAnd Healing With Empathy\nWe Can Help\nWe know what it feels like when your pet is injured or in need of specialty care, and you feel like you have nowhere to turn.\nOur highly trained team is looking forward to being your partner in your pet’s veterinary care.\nChoose your location and the service that you need.\nFrederick, MD\n7330 GUILFORD DRIVE\nFREDERICK, MD 21704\n301.200.8185\nEMERGENCY\nURGENT CARE\nSPECIALTY\nRichmond, VA\n1616 THREE CHOPT ROAD\nHENRICO, VA 23233\n804.206.9122\nEMERGENCY\nURGENT CARE\nSPECIALTY\nPre-Register Your Pet\nPre-registering with Partner helps expedite the check-in process should an emergency strike. It’s easy, it’s free, and it will be one less thing for you to worry about if your pet becomes sick or injured.\nPRE-REGISTER\nOUR MISSION\nPartner Veterinary’s mission is to provide the best workplace for veterinary talent so that we are the provider of choice for expert and compassionate emergency and specialty veterinary care in our communities.\nOur Core Values\nCommunity Care\nWe lead with compassion and a “We Can Help” spirit, knowing that every act of support—big or small—strengthens our team, uplifts our clients, and builds a better veterinary community both inside and beyond our walls.\nEmpower\nWe each take ownership of our role, share information openly, and work with purpose—knowing our contributions directly shape our team, our patients’ outcomes, and the future of Partner.\nReimagining\nWe challenge the status quo daily—embracing fresh ideas, people-first solutions, and collaborative innovation to build a better, more inclusive future for our team and the families we serve.\nMake A Healing Impact\nJoin the team at Partner Veterinary and help us heal an industry in distress. We’re seeking specialists, emergency doctors, care advocates, and nursing support professionals who are eager to break free from outdated paradigms and love their profession again.\nCAREERS\nContact Us\nEmergency\nFrederick Specialties\nRichmond Specialties\nCareers\nAbout Us\nContact Us\nFAQ\nVeterinarians\nOpt-out preferences\nFacebook\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\n© 2026 All Rights Reserved |\nAccessibility",
